  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COMPASS Migration Partnership Funding - Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This COMPASS MPF programme will allow DSH/MO to flexibly and efficiently identify programmes to be implemented by IOM in support of bilateral migration partnerships with priority countries. The exact projects to be funded from this budget will be submitted in multiple rounds, and assessed and approved individually. Under the first round, EUR 39,8 mln. was allocated to IOM for the period 2026-2027.

Under the second round of approval in June 2026 three additional programmes in Libya (5 mln) Ethiopia (4 mln) and Somalia (5 mln) will be approved for in total EUR 14 mln., resulting in a total budget of EUR 53,8 mln.</narrative>
  </description>
